---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
    <main class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 py-4 sm:py-6 md:py-8">
        <div class="mb-4 sm:mb-6">
            <a href="/home" class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-2 bg-gray-200 hover:bg-[#00bbff40] text-white rounded-[50%] transition-colors duration-200 back-button cursor-none">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="h-5 w-5 sm:h-6 sm:w-6" fill="#000000">
                    <path d="M9.4 233.4c-12.5 12.5-12.5 32.8 0 45.3l160 160c12.5 12.5 32.8 12.5 45.3 0s12.5-32.8 0-45.3L109.2 288 416 288c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32s-14.3-32-32-32l-306.7 0L214.6 118.6c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3s-32.8-12.5-45.3 0l-160 160z"/>
                </svg>
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-xl sm:max-w-2xl lg:max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-6 md:p-8">
            <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-6 sm:gap-8">
                <div class="w-32 h-32 sm:w-40 sm:h-40 md:w-48 md:h-48 overflow-hidden rounded-full border-4 border-green-200 flex-shrink-0">
                    <img 
                        src="/peeps-avatar.png" 
                        alt="Profile Avatar" 
                        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                    />
                </div>
                
                <div class="flex-1 text-center lg:text-left">
                    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold mb-2 sm:mb-3 font-reenie">Hi, I'm Darsh :)</h1>
                    <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl lg:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-600 mb-3 sm:mb-4 font">UI/UX Designer & Developer</h2>
                    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font px-2 sm:px-0">
                        I design things that serve a purpose and evoke delight. I simplify the complex, craft memorability, and build experiences that last.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-4 sm:mt-6 flex gap-4 items-center cursor-none ">
                        <a onclick="window.location.href='mailto:darshdp1454@gmail.com?subject=Inquiry%20from%20Portfolio%20Website&body=Hello%20Darsh,%0A%0AI%20visited%20your%20portfolio%20website%20and%20would%20like%20to%20connect%20thankyou'" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center px-4 sm:px-6 py-2 sm:py-3 bg-[#00bbff] hover:bg-[#0099cc] transition transform active:scale-95 text-white rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl text-sm sm:text-base transition-duration-300">
                        Reach Out!
                        </a>
                        <a href="https://x.com/Darsh1454">
                        <div class="Xlogo cursor-none flex items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-black text-white hover:opacity-85">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 48 48" id="x-twitter">
                                <path fill="#ffffff" d="M36.6526 3.8078H43.3995L28.6594 20.6548L46 43.5797H32.4225L21.7881 29.6759L9.61989 43.5797H2.86886L18.6349 25.56L2 3.8078H15.9222L25.5348 16.5165L36.6526 3.8078ZM34.2846 39.5414H38.0232L13.8908 7.63406H9.87892L34.2846 39.5414Z">
                                </path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="max-w-xl sm:max-w-2xl lg:max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mt-12 sm:mt-16 md:mt-20 px-4">
            <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl lg:text-2xl font-semibold text-black mb-3 sm:mb-4 font leading-relaxed">
                The only requirement is awesomeness - at the idea, redesign, or reinvention stage
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font text-left sm:text-center">
                I partner with driven founders to build the next amazing thing. Whether they're at the napkin idea stage, redesign phase, or building on top of an existing product, we work together to make the future come a little sooner.
                <br><br>
                At the core of my services is product design - my bread and butter - for web, mobile, or desktop platforms. Additional services include website design, advanced prototyping and animation, design systems, custom iconography and illustration. Each service comes with its own unique solution and fresh ideas - no cookie-cutter or one-size-fits-all solutions.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-6 sm:mt-8">
                <a onclick="window.location.href='mailto:darshdp1454@gmail.com?subject=Inquiry%20for%20Project%20Collabration'" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 py-2 sm:py-3 bg-[#00bbff] hover:bg-[#0099cc] transition transform active:scale-95 text-white rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl text-sm sm:text-base transition-duration-300">
                Tell me about your project
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-xl sm:max-w-2xl lg:max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mt-12 sm:mt-16 md:mt-20 px-4">
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed font">
                I'm located in Gujarat, India timezone (IST). <br class="hidden sm:block">I'll get back to you as soon as I can.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 sm:mt-6 text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-reenie font-semibold transform rotate-[-4deg] sm:rotate-[-8deg]">
                Cheers Darsh:)
            </p>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>

<style>
    .font-reenie {
        font-family: 'Reenie Beanie', cursive;
    }
</style>